    "detailed_description": "<h1>100 Wishlist Milestone!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323070/extras/d7bb89f567e67200086717e68a844d70.avif?t=1747447374\" /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323070/extras/320ca18eb1822712ef671aab356e548b.poster.avif?t=1747447374\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323070/extras/320ca18eb1822712ef671aab356e548b.webm?t=1747447374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323070/extras/320ca18eb1822712ef671aab356e548b.mp4?t=1747447374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Lokaa is a beautiful first-person adventure about Lyra, a woman who travels to a fabled tower in hopes of fulfilling a wish. In your journey, step into the shoes of Lyra, discover charming natural vistas and uncover the secrets deep within the ancient tower.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323070/extras/e8a3b128e16204a1c644c76228f1e2e0.poster.avif?t=1747447374\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323070/extras/e8a3b128e16204a1c644c76228f1e2e0.webm?t=1747447374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2323070/extras/e8a3b128e16204a1c644c76228f1e2e0.mp4?t=1747447374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Peaceful music</h2>Chill out as you explore a mysterious forgotten world<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Emotional story and lore written by the developer</h2>Uncover tales from the past and discover secrets more than a century old<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore massive megastructures from an ancient civilisation</h2>Explore remnants of a lost civilisation, disconnected from the fabric of reality<br></li><li><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relatively short experience that you can finish in one sitting</h2>Grab a coffee!</li></ul>",
